<title>INDIA: India Indo Gulf 1996/97 net falls.</title>
<headline>India Indo Gulf 1996/97 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>		  (in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		1,083.4     vs     1,452.3</p>
<p>    Div (in rupees)	     1.8     vs	   1.8</p>
<p>    Turnover		  4,387.7     vs     5,655.1</p>
<p>    Gross profit	    1,639.2     vs     2,273.4</p>
<p>    Depreciation		400.8     vs	 326.1</p>
<p>    Taxation		    155.0     vs	 495.0</p>
<p>Note: Indo-Gulf Fertilisers and Chemical Corp is a major urea maker and a member of the Aditya Birla Group of companies.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
